message: "If you use Akeratos, its models or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Akeratos: pretrain small language models from scratch on a Mac with MLX"
abstract: "Pretrain a small language model from scratch on your Mac with MLX. The starter model trains in 41 minutes and 6.7 GiB on an M4 Max. Billet, a 162M-parameter transformer with a learned n-gram table of 6.0 billion numbers, scores 0.8866 held-out bits per byte (lower is better) against 0.9030 for the same model without the table, one seed each. Open code, data recipes, weights, training logs and a 5-minute Mac speedrun."
type: software
